.TH WM-REMOTE 1
.SH NAME
remotelogon, rmtdir \- remote access windows
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wm/remotelogon
.RB [ -u
.IR user ]
.RB [ -p
.IR passwd ]
.I command
.RI [ arg ...]
.br
.B wm/rmtdir
.SH DESCRIPTION
.TP
.B wm/remotelogon
Gets a certificate to enable remote access, then runs
.I command
.RI [ arg ...]
with it.
.TP
.B wm/rmtdir
A window prompting for a
.RI net!machine
address to dial, then browses the remote machine's directory tree
over that connection \(em the network-remote counterpart to
.IR dir (1).
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/wm/remotelogon.b
.br
.B /appl/wm/rmtdir.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR dir (1)
